{"id":3243,"slug":"3243-transition-va-transitiongroup-trong-vue","category":"Vue.js","subcategory":"Chuyên Sâu","level":"advanced","question_vi":"Transition và TransitionGroup trong Vue?","question_en":"Transition and TransitionGroup in Vue?","answer_vi":"`<Transition>` apply CSS classes khi element enter/leave:\n```vue\n<Transition name=\"fade\">\n  <p v-if=\"show\">Hello</p>\n</Transition>\n```\n```css\n.fade-enter-active, .fade-leave-active { transition: opacity 0.3s; }\n.fade-enter-from, .fade-leave-to { opacity: 0; }\n```\n`<TransitionGroup>` cho list animations — thêm `move` class:\n```vue\n<TransitionGroup name=\"list\" tag=\"ul\">\n  <li v-for=\"item in items\" :key=\"item.id\">{{ item.name }}</li>\n</TransitionGroup>\n```\nModes: `mode=\"out-in\"` (old leaves trước, new enters sau) — tránh flickering khi swap components.","answer_en":"`<Transition>` applies CSS classes when elements enter/leave:\n```vue\n<Transition name=\"fade\">\n  <p v-if=\"show\">Hello</p>\n</Transition>\n```\n```css\n.fade-enter-active, .fade-leave-active { transition: opacity 0.3s; }\n.fade-enter-from, .fade-leave-to { opacity: 0; }\n```\n`<TransitionGroup>` for list animations — adds `move` class:\n```vue\n<TransitionGroup name=\"list\" tag=\"ul\">\n  <li v-for=\"item in items\" :key=\"item.id\">{{ item.name }}</li>\n</TransitionGroup>\n```\nModes: `mode=\"out-in\"` (old leaves first, new enters after) — prevents flickering when swapping components.","answer_html_vi":"<p><code>&lt;Transition&gt;</code> apply CSS classes khi element enter/leave:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">vue</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;Transition name=&quot;fade&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;p v-if=&quot;show&quot;&gt;Hello&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/Transition&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">Transition</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;fade&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">v-if</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;show&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Hello<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">Transition</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">css</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\".fade-enter-active, .fade-leave-active { transition: opacity 0.3s; }\n.fade-enter-from, .fade-leave-to { opacity: 0; }\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=